  - english: When HP is below 50% gain attack speed and power
    vietnamese: "Khi m\xE1u d\u01B0\u1EDBi 50%, t\u0103ng t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 \u0111\xE1nh v\xE0 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh"
