    portuguese: "Os itens de cura ficam mais fortes e aumentam a vida m\xE1xima"
    french: Les objets de soin deviennent plus efficaces et augmentent la vie maximale
  - english: Eliminations have a chance to recover HP
    vietnamese: "H\u1EA1 g\u1EE5c k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch c\xF3 c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i h\u1ED3i m\xE1u"
