    portuguese: Crie uma bolha que absorve um golpe
    french: "Cr\xE9ez une bulle qui absorbe un coup"
  - english: Come back to the fight instantly after defeat. Once per run
    vietnamese: "H\u1ED3i sinh ngay sau khi b\u1ECB h\u1EA1 g\u1EE5c. M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i l\u01B0\u1EE3t ch\u01A1i"
